# ============================================================
#  AMORAI · environment template
#  Copy to .env.local for `vercel dev`, AND set the same keys in
#  Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#  NEVER commit .env.local. NEVER put the secret/API keys in index.html.
# ============================================================

# ---- OpenRouter (existing) ----
